<!--
  Copy to ~/.claude/local/CLAUDE.work.md. The installer appends this to the public
  claude/CLAUDE.md to produce ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md.

  This is where org-specific rules go: cloud accounts and regions, IaC conventions,
  ticket prefixes, knowledge-base paths. Also anything personal you would rather not
  publish — a writing-voice profile, for instance, is not confidential but it is a
  fingerprint, and the public half of this repo is world-readable.
-->

